1
00:00:03,466 --> 00:00:04,600
Damn Lewes

2
00:00:04,666 --> 00:00:05,600
You have a secret feed

3
00:00:05,633 --> 00:00:06,233
And didn't tell me earlier

4
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:07,533
Holding out on me

5
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:09,566
Once I steal the recipe

6
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:11,100
And fatten up my frogs

7
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,533
Your multimillion order will be mine

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:20,833
Why are you back

9
00:00:22,233 --> 00:00:23,233
Lewes

10
00:00:23,233 --> 00:00:24,233
I was wrong before

11
00:00:24,466 --> 00:00:26,466
I'm here today to apologize

12
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:30,600
What are you plotting now

13
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,500
Don't always think the worst of me

14
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:33,733
Let's talk inside

15
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:37,066
Let's just talk here

16
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:38,333
The farm is a restricted area

17
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:39,333
No outsiders allowed

18
00:00:42,666 --> 00:00:43,200
Brother-in-law

19
00:00:43,866 --> 00:00:45,033
I borrowed from a loan shark

20
00:00:45,533 --> 00:00:47,266
The interest gets higher every day

21
00:00:48,033 --> 00:00:49,246
If I can't sell this batch of frogs

22
00:00:49,246 --> 00:00:49,766
at a good price

23
00:00:50,233 --> 00:00:51,433
I'm dead meat

24
00:00:51,433 --> 00:00:53,066
You're the only one who can help me now

25
00:00:53,066 --> 00:00:54,133
How do you want me to help you

26
00:00:55,066 --> 00:00:56,066
I knew you

27
00:00:56,066 --> 00:00:56,800
Value loyalty the most

28
00:00:57,133 --> 00:00:57,866
And wouldn't abandon me

29
00:00:58,466 --> 00:00:58,833
How about this

30
00:00:59,000 --> 00:00:59,400
Brother-in-law

31
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:01,233
I heard you have a secret feed

32
00:01:01,533 --> 00:01:03,266
That makes the frogs grow big and fat

33
00:01:04,233 --> 00:01:05,466
Can you give me the recipe

34
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:06,633
I'll pay for it

35
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,300
The recipe took me two years

36
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,033
And hundreds of tests to develop

37
00:01:10,466 --> 00:01:11,600
I've already patented it

38
00:01:11,633 --> 00:01:12,266
It's not for sale

39
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:14,300
If you're here for this

40
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:16,033
You can leave now

41
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:19,366
Hey brother-in-law

42
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
I don't want the recipe

43
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,833
Can I just buy your feed

44
00:01:22,933 --> 00:01:23,966
Sell me the finished product

45
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,700
And I'll feed them myself

46
00:01:26,633 --> 00:01:27,266
Daniel

47
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,500
How you treated me before

48
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:30,484
You might have forgotten

49
00:01:30,484 --> 00:01:31,000
but I haven't

50
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:32,533
I won't sell you the feed

51
00:01:32,933 --> 00:01:33,533
Just leave

52
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,200
You

53
00:01:34,733 --> 00:01:35,233
Fine

54
00:01:35,833 --> 00:01:36,500
You just wait

55
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:38,500
This order will definitely be

56
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:39,233
mine

57
00:01:41,266 --> 00:01:41,733
Wait
